Backline is a renamed fork of the project previously published as Phone Farm iOS
Core by the Git-Agni contributors. This line is the attribution the licence
requires; the old name is not used anywhere else in this repository.

This product includes software developed by its contributors and dependencies whose notices are distributed with their respective packages.

The device driver layer (src/drivers) adapts patterns from:
- simvyn (https://github.com/pranshuchittora/simvyn), MIT — adb device discovery and command shapes.
- sim-use (https://github.com/lycorp-jp/sim-use), Apache-2.0 — the Android device bridge HTTP protocol and tree-first verification loop.
